<h2 class="g-h2" id="behaviour">Behaviour</h2>
<div class="g-prose"><p>The switch here is the opinion page's "Treatment beside citations": <code>text_signals.js</code> toggles <code>text-signals-off</code> on <code>&lt;html&gt;</code>, remembers it, and <code>shell_state.js</code> restores it before the first paint. Try it: the setting is shared with the app's opinion pages in this browser.</p></div>

<h2 class="g-h2" id="accessibility">Accessibility</h2>
<div class="g-prose"><p>A placeholder is not a label. Group related checkboxes in a <code>&lt;fieldset&gt;</code> with a <code>&lt;legend&gt;</code>. For a field that fails validation, set <code>aria-invalid="true"</code> and point <code>aria-describedby</code> at the message.</p></div>

